{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14752","headline":"送夏侯校书归华阴别墅 · 卢纶","name":"送夏侯校书归华阴别墅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山前白鹤村，竹雪覆柴门。\n候客定爲黍，务农因燎原。\n乳冰悬暗井，莲石照晴轩。\n贳酒邻里睦，曝衣场圃喧。\n依然望君去，余性亦何昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}